$DATUM The reaction mixture was stirred at 50 °C for a total of 3 h, after which
time a clear solution was formed. The solution was cooled to r.t., then
concentrated to approximately 12 mL and then poured into hexanes (40 mL).
The resulting mixture was stored in a freezer (-20 °C) overnight. The
white crystals formed during this time were collected and dried under
vacuum to give the corresponding NCA. Yield 1.763g, 89%.
