$DATUM N-[2,2-Bis(2,4-diacetoxy-3-methylphenyl)ethyl]-N-methyl-acetamide (6). A
mixture of amine 4 (0.5 g, 1.47 mmol), acetic anhydride (1.5 g, 14.7
mmol), and pyridine (0.1 mL) was kept at 20 °С for 6 h. The volatile
components were removed, the residue was dried in vacuo (1 h, 60 °C, 0.4
Torr). Compound 6 was obtained. Yield 0.61 g, 88%. m.p. 200-201 °С. Found
(%): C, 63.50; Н, 6.83; N, 2.27. C27H31NO9. Calculated (%): C, 63.15; H,
6.08; N, 2.73. 1H NMR ((CD3)2CO), δ: 2.01 (s, 6 Н, Me); 2.35-2.52 (br.s,
15 Н, Ac); 2.71 (s, 3 Н, NMe); 3.91 (m, 2 Н, СН2); 4.87 (m, 1 Н, СН);
6.42 (d, 2 Н, H(5) arom., 3J = 8.29 Hz); 6.61 (d, 2 Н, H(6) arom., 3J =
8.29 Hz).
